 "remarks": "Welcome to this well-located 3-bedroom, 1-bathroom second-floor apartment in desirable East Norwalk. Offering a comfortable layout, a separate dining room, an eat-in kitchen, living room, private basement storage, and convenient access to transportation, the beach, shopping, and dining, this home is a great opportunity to enjoy everything East Norwalk has to offer.  The apartment features three spacious bedrooms, one full bathroom, a comfortable living area, and a dedicated dining room. The eat-in kitchen provides additional space for casual meals and everyday living. The private basement offers ample storage and includes laundry hookups for added convenience.  The location is a major highlight. Enjoy being within walking distance of the beach and train station, while also having easy access to I-95, shopping, restaurants, and everyday amenities. Whether you're commuting into the city, spending a day at the beach, enjoying a meal out, or simply running errands, everything you need is conveniently close by",
